[
  {
    "sound": "https://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/mp3/3a09a7e2dca6dc7392748b7e09f095d8_27816.mp3",
    "author": "李清照",
    "author_id": 0,
    "dynasty": "宋代",
    "id": "52797",
    "sound_pic": "https://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/images/3a0c3c6916f7f0495bd227afc9440c34_909_1154.png",
    "isCollect": false,
    "pure_content": "归鸿声断残云碧。背窗雪落炉烟直。烛底凤钗明。钗头人胜轻。\n角声催晓漏。曙色回牛斗。春意看花难。西风留旧寒。",
    "playing": false,
    "sound_duration": 27816,
    "name": "菩萨蛮·归鸿声断残云碧"
  },
  {
    "sound": "https://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/mp3/3a098a638416879f00bc3dfb2e2f4bde_37968.mp3",
    "author": "李清照",
    "author_id": 0,
    "dynasty": "宋代",
    "id": "52831",
    "sound_pic": "https://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/images/3a0c3c80387630398199bf81691d6d95_909_1154.png",
    "isCollect": false,
    "pure_content": "暗淡轻黄体性柔，情疏迹远只香留。何须浅碧深红色，自是花中第一流。(深一作：轻)\n梅定妒，菊应羞，画阑开处冠中秋。骚人可煞无情思，何事当年不见收。(阑通：栏)",
    "playing": false,
    "sound_duration": 37968,
    "name": "鹧鸪天·桂花"
  },
  {
    "sound": "https://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/mp3/3a0ecac22d1567e8a4b0036f2d706d0f_45624.mp3",
    "author": "李清照",
    "author_id": 0,
    "dynasty": "宋代",
    "id": "52820",
    "sound_pic": "https://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/images/3a0c3c6ed3754129f5cee21c56314948_909_1154.png",
    "isCollect": false,
    "pure_content": "永夜恹恹欢意少。空梦长安，认取长安道。为报今年春色好，花光月影宜相照。\n随意杯盘虽草草。酒美梅酸，恰称人怀抱。醉里插花花莫笑，可怜春似人将老。",
    "playing": false,
    "sound_duration": 45624,
    "name": "蝶恋花·上巳召亲族"
  },
  {
    "sound": "https://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/mp3/3a098e39ccc78604a5ba068b26bf50a3_30840.mp3",
    "author": "李清照",
    "author_id": 0,
    "dynasty": "宋代",
    "id": "52822",
    "sound_pic": "https://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/images/3a0c3c70a56d127aadeb8b450d0acdd3_909_1154.png",
    "isCollect": false,
    "pure_content": "寂寞深闺，柔肠一寸愁千缕。惜春春去，几点催花雨。\n倚遍阑干，只是无情绪。人何处，连天衰草，望断归来路。(衰一作：芳)",
    "playing": false,
    "sound_duration": 30840,
    "name": "点绛唇·闺思"
  },
  {
    "sound": "http://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/mp3/3a0377382e870178a9d661a25b5e6804_96528.mp3",
    "author": "杜甫",
    "author_id": 0,
    "dynasty": "唐代",
    "id": "10521",
    "sound_pic": "http://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/images/3a038670b262fbc8d249ee0cfa3d9995_909_1154.jpg",
    "isCollect": false,
    "pure_content": "八月秋高风怒号，卷我屋上三重茅。茅飞渡江洒江郊，高者挂罥长林梢，下者飘转沉塘坳。\n南村群童欺我老无力，忍能对面为盗贼。公然抱茅入竹去，唇焦口燥呼不得，归来倚杖自叹息。\n俄顷风定云墨色，秋天漠漠向昏黑。布衾多年冷似铁，娇儿恶卧踏里裂。床头屋漏无干处，雨脚如麻未断绝。自经丧乱少睡眠，长夜沾湿何由彻！\n安得广厦千万间，大庇天下寒士俱欢颜！风雨不动安如山。呜呼！何时眼前突兀见此屋，吾庐独破受冻死亦足！",
    "playing": false,
    "sound_duration": 96528,
    "name": "茅屋为秋风所破歌"
  },
  {
    "sound": "https://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/mp3/3a10808c8c37269015cc000a1fed3906_38592.mp3",
    "author": "苏轼",
    "author_id": 0,
    "dynasty": "宋代",
    "id": "49481",
    "isCollect": false,
    "pure_content": "花褪残红青杏小，燕子飞时，绿水人家绕。枝上柳绵吹又少，天涯何处无芳草。\n墙里秋千墙外道，墙外行人，墙里佳人笑。笑渐不闻声渐悄，多情却被无情恼。",
    "playing": false,
    "sound_duration": 38592,
    "name": "蝶恋花·春景"
  },
  {
    "sound": "https://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/mp3/3a153970e7931192f0dd2947000bfd8b_36101.mp3",
    "author": "苏轼",
    "author_id": 0,
    "dynasty": "宋代",
    "id": "49409",
    "isCollect": false,
    "pure_content": "世事一场大梦，人生几度秋凉？夜来风叶已鸣廊。看取眉头鬓上。(秋凉一作：新凉)\n酒贱常愁客少，月明多被云妨。中秋谁与共孤光。把盏凄然北望。",
    "playing": false,
    "sound_duration": 36101,
    "name": "西江月·世事一场大梦"
  },
  {
    "sound": "http://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/mp3/3a05c7949364fee5becbe8eafe53af74_43807.mp3",
    "author": "佚名",
    "author_id": 0,
    "dynasty": "先秦",
    "id": "1",
    "sound_pic": "https://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/images/3a05c79473daae177bf01459a77318f5_909_1154.jpg",
    "isCollect": false,
    "pure_content": "关关雎鸠，在河之洲。窈窕淑女，君子好逑。\n参差荇菜，左右流之。窈窕淑女，寤寐求之。\n求之不得，寤寐思服。悠哉悠哉，辗转反侧。\n参差荇菜，左右采之。窈窕淑女，琴瑟友之。\n参差荇菜，左右芼之。窈窕淑女，钟鼓乐之。",
    "playing": false,
    "sound_duration": 43807,
    "name": "关雎"
  },
  {
    "sound": "http://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/mp3/3a037ae0e287ad8928dbcfc68fea0c9b_19608.mp3",
    "author": "杜牧",
    "author_id": 0,
    "dynasty": "唐代",
    "id": "27824",
    "sound_pic": "http://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/images/3a03867a6f04a713448de48dda887bd8_909_1154.jpg",
    "isCollect": false,
    "pure_content": "远上寒山石径斜，白云生处有人家。(生处一作：深处)\n停车坐爱枫林晚，霜叶红于二月花。",
    "playing": false,
    "sound_duration": 19608,
    "name": "山行"
  },
  {
    "sound": "http://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/mp3/3a0454f2cd2dfb77fea04db3a97534a5_19200.mp3",
    "author": "李峤",
    "author_id": 0,
    "dynasty": "唐代",
    "id": "3493",
    "sound_pic": "https://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/images/3a087494ce7135620800d37beac301b5_909_1154.png",
    "isCollect": false,
    "pure_content": "解落三秋叶，能开二月花。\n过江千尺浪，入竹万竿斜。",
    "playing": false,
    "sound_duration": 19200,
    "name": "风"
  },
  {
    "sound": "https://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/mp3/3a070b6a740503e4f3e0ffcc707f7d6f_20480.mp3",
    "author": "李白",
    "author_id": 0,
    "dynasty": "唐代",
    "id": "7826",
    "isCollect": false,
    "pure_content": "长安一片月，万户捣衣声。\n秋风吹不尽，总是玉关情。\n何日平胡虏，良人罢远征。",
    "playing": false,
    "sound_duration": 20480,
    "name": "子夜吴歌·秋歌"
  },
  {
    "sound": "http://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/mp3/3a0454f24fd505453a8c654ffb8bc4a2_59904.mp3",
    "author": "李白",
    "author_id": 0,
    "dynasty": "唐代",
    "id": "7766",
    "sound_pic": "https://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/images/3a0874946de0c7ec0c646276740cefc4_909_1154.png",
    "isCollect": false,
    "pure_content": "小时不识月，呼作白玉盘。\n又疑瑶台镜，飞在青云端。(青云一作：白云)\n仙人垂两足，桂树何团团。\n白兔捣药成，问言与谁餐？\n蟾蜍蚀圆影，大明夜已残。\n羿昔落九乌，天人清且安。\n阴精此沦惑，去去不足观。\n忧来其如何？凄怆摧心肝。",
    "playing": false,
    "sound_duration": 59904,
    "name": "古朗月行"
  },
  {
    "sound": "http://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/mp3/3a05e48c7868ab28361a884f3bc8c0b2_95352.mp3",
    "author": "李白",
    "author_id": 0,
    "dynasty": "唐代",
    "id": "7722",
    "sound_pic": "https://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/images/3a05e48c246264505537f8f112af8305_909_1154.jpg",
    "isCollect": false,
    "pure_content": "君不见黄河之水天上来，奔流到海不复回。\n君不见高堂明镜悲白发，朝如青丝暮成雪。\n人生得意须尽欢，莫使金樽空对月。\n天生我材必有用，千金散尽还复来。\n烹羊宰牛且为乐，会须一饮三百杯。\n岑夫子，丹丘生，将进酒，杯莫停。\n与君歌一曲，请君为我倾耳听。(倾耳听 一作：侧耳听)\n钟鼓馔玉不足贵，但愿长醉不愿醒。(不足贵 一作：何足贵；不愿醒 一作：不复醒)\n古来圣贤皆寂寞，惟有饮者留其名。(古来 一作：自古；惟 通：唯)\n陈王昔时宴平乐，斗酒十千恣欢谑。\n主人何为言少钱，径须沽取对君酌。\n五花马、千金裘，呼儿将出换美酒，与尔同销万古愁。",
    "playing": false,
    "sound_duration": 95352,
    "name": "将进酒",
    "video_id": "35"
  },
  {
    "sound": "http://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/mp3/3a03ceb73de8d3e747c873e8cc906865_18984.mp3",
    "author": "李白",
    "author_id": 0,
    "dynasty": "唐代",
    "id": "8411",
    "sound_pic": "https://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/images/3a07cf937297050aa45e0105e9d410f0_909_1154.jpg",
    "isCollect": false,
    "pure_content": "众鸟高飞尽，孤云独去闲。\n相看两不厌，只有敬亭山。",
    "playing": false,
    "sound_duration": 18984,
    "name": "独坐敬亭山"
  },
  {
    "sound": "https://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/mp3/3a08a78358c3dd31df94b63bd9e4fbb7_56136.mp3",
    "author": "李白",
    "author_id": 0,
    "dynasty": "唐代",
    "id": "70862",
    "isCollect": false,
    "pure_content": "花间一壶酒，独酌无相亲。\n举杯邀明月，对影成三人。\n月既不解饮，影徒随我身。\n暂伴月将影，行乐须及春。\n我歌月徘徊，我舞影零乱。\n醒时相交欢，醉后各分散。(相交欢一作：同交欢)\n永结无情游，相期邈云汉。",
    "playing": false,
    "sound_duration": 56136,
    "name": "月下独酌四首·其一"
  },
  {
    "sound": "https://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/mp3/3a1539555a4d7fb1de933d5bc6463b82_44068.mp3",
    "author": "李白",
    "author_id": 0,
    "dynasty": "唐代",
    "id": "47069",
    "isCollect": false,
    "pure_content": "平林漠漠烟如织，寒山一带伤心碧。暝色入高楼，有人楼上愁。\n玉阶空伫立，宿鸟归飞急。何处是归程？长亭更短亭。(更短亭一作：连短亭)",
    "playing": false,
    "sound_duration": 44068,
    "name": "菩萨蛮·平林漠漠烟如织"
  },
  {
    "sound": "https://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/mp3/3a08081ab7194e117bc9f534d8fb95cd_16195.mp3",
    "author": "李白",
    "author_id": 0,
    "dynasty": "唐代",
    "id": "8502",
    "isCollect": false,
    "pure_content": "美人卷珠帘，深坐颦蛾眉。\n但见泪痕湿，不知心恨谁。",
    "playing": false,
    "sound_duration": 16195,
    "name": "怨情"
  },
  {
    "sound": "https://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/mp3/3a075279d5c70996f31702ee3295f74f_26424.mp3",
    "author": "李白",
    "author_id": 0,
    "dynasty": "唐代",
    "id": "8027",
    "sound_pic": "https://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/images/3a075271821d84de1112678432f62c5a_909_1154.png",
    "isCollect": false,
    "pure_content": "杨花落尽子规啼，闻道龙标过五溪。\n我寄愁心与明月，随君直到夜郎西。(随君一作：随风)",
    "playing": false,
    "sound_duration": 26424,
    "name": "闻王昌龄左迁龙标遥有此寄"
  },
  {
    "sound": "http://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/mp3/3a037ad6ddbeace56fcd9b2324385502_28248.mp3",
    "author": "李白",
    "author_id": 0,
    "dynasty": "唐代",
    "id": "7816",
    "sound_pic": "http://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/images/3a03867525f681764581a799e37180d8_909_1154.jpg",
    "isCollect": false,
    "pure_content": "床前明月光，疑是地上霜。\n举头望明月，低头思故乡。",
    "playing": false,
    "sound_duration": 28248,
    "name": "静夜思"
  },
  {
    "sound": "http://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/mp3/3a04597f706bda7f495c289a88ef10c2_30288.mp3",
    "author": "李白",
    "author_id": 0,
    "dynasty": "唐代",
    "id": "8086",
    "sound_pic": "https://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/images/3a09a9a6dd86617248d3c476424cb666_909_1154.png",
    "isCollect": false,
    "pure_content": "故人西辞黄鹤楼，烟花三月下扬州。\n孤帆远影碧空尽，唯见长江天际流。",
    "playing": false,
    "sound_duration": 30288,
    "name": "黄鹤楼送孟浩然之广陵"
  },
  {
    "sound": "https://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/mp3/3a0a8c3ae7c805366e0ba7e476d3ea48_62256.mp3",
    "author": "李白",
    "author_id": 0,
    "dynasty": "唐代",
    "id": "8488",
    "isCollect": false,
    "pure_content": "秋风清，秋月明，\n落叶聚还散，寒鸦栖复惊。\n相思相见知何日？此时此夜难为情！\n入我相思门，知我相思苦，\n长相思兮长相忆，短相思兮无穷极，\n早知如此绊人心，何如当初莫相识。(后三句存疑)",
    "playing": false,
    "sound_duration": 62256,
    "name": "三五七言 / 秋风词"
  },
  {
    "sound": "http://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/mp3/3a037ad9c210a51c1a3ed8f5a20ba5b5_24168.mp3",
    "author": "李白",
    "author_id": 0,
    "dynasty": "唐代",
    "id": "71193",
    "sound_pic": "http://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/images/3a038677f26a20fa30573638d8c130bf_909_1154.jpg",
    "isCollect": false,
    "pure_content": "日照香炉生紫烟，遥看瀑布挂前川。\n飞流直下三千尺，疑是银河落九天。",
    "playing": false,
    "sound_duration": 24168,
    "name": "望庐山瀑布"
  },
  {
    "sound": "https://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/mp3/3a0807a52bac5542d5a13435c325aff7_34368.mp3",
    "author": "李白",
    "author_id": 0,
    "dynasty": "唐代",
    "id": "7741",
    "isCollect": false,
    "pure_content": "明月出天山，苍茫云海间。\n长风几万里，吹度玉门关。\n汉下白登道，胡窥青海湾。\n由来征战地，不见有人还。\n戍客望边邑，思归多苦颜。(望边邑一作：望边色)\n高楼当此夜，叹息未应闲。",
    "playing": false,
    "sound_duration": 34368,
    "name": "关山月"
  },
  {
    "sound": "http://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/mp3/3a04fd479801ff7f8fc6e9d514c4aa56_132362.mp3",
    "author": "李白",
    "author_id": 0,
    "dynasty": "唐代",
    "id": "7717",
    "sound_pic": "https://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/images/3a09ad290f060abf14aafcd5ce8b18c8_909_1154.png",
    "isCollect": false,
    "pure_content": "噫吁嚱，危乎高哉！\n蜀道之难，难于上青天！\n蚕丛及鱼凫，开国何茫然！\n尔来四万八千岁，不与秦塞通人烟。\n西当太白有鸟道，可以横绝峨眉巅。\n地崩山摧壮士死，然后天梯石栈相钩连。\n上有六龙回日之高标，下有冲波逆折之回川。\n黄鹤之飞尚不得过，猿猱欲度愁攀援。\n青泥何盘盘，百步九折萦岩峦。\n扪参历井仰胁息，以手抚膺坐长叹。\n问君西游何时还？畏途巉岩不可攀。\n但见悲鸟号古木，雄飞雌从绕林间。\n又闻子规啼夜月，愁空山。\n蜀道之难，难于上青天，使人听此凋朱颜！\n连峰去天不盈尺，枯松倒挂倚绝壁。\n飞湍瀑流争喧豗，砯崖转石万壑雷。\n其险也如此，嗟尔远道之人胡为乎来哉！(也如此一作：也若此)\n剑阁峥嵘而崔嵬，一夫当关，万夫莫开。\n所守或匪亲，化为狼与豺。\n朝避猛虎，夕避长蛇，磨牙吮血，杀人如麻。\n锦城虽云乐，不如早还家。\n蜀道之难，难于上青天，侧身西望长咨嗟！",
    "playing": false,
    "sound_duration": 132362,
    "name": "蜀道难"
  },
  {
    "sound": "http://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/mp3/3a0454fa56837d72c500b6b8f410fbba_20376.mp3",
    "author": "李白",
    "author_id": 0,
    "dynasty": "唐代",
    "id": "8345",
    "isCollect": false,
    "pure_content": "朝辞白帝彩云间，千里江陵一日还。\n两岸猿声啼不住，轻舟已过万重山。",
    "playing": false,
    "sound_duration": 20376,
    "name": "早发白帝城"
  },
  {
    "sound": "https://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/mp3/3a06dd328245a4a0b4f2e8f7ed276fb1_46080.mp3",
    "author": "李白",
    "author_id": 0,
    "dynasty": "唐代",
    "id": "8180",
    "isCollect": false,
    "pure_content": "弃我去者，昨日之日不可留；\n乱我心者，今日之日多烦忧。\n长风万里送秋雁，对此可以酣高楼。\n蓬莱文章建安骨，中间小谢又清发。\n俱怀逸兴壮思飞，欲上青天揽明月。(揽一作：览；明月一作：日月)\n抽刀断水水更流，举杯销愁愁更愁。(销愁一作：消愁)\n人生在世不称意，明朝散发弄扁舟。",
    "playing": false,
    "sound_duration": 46080,
    "name": "宣州谢朓楼饯别校书叔云"
  },
  {
    "sound": "http://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/mp3/3a037ae18bb6f0a63b0b3e8462bab653_19800.mp3",
    "author": "李白",
    "author_id": 0,
    "dynasty": "唐代",
    "id": "8328",
    "sound_pic": "http://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/images/3a03867ab60345055cf5e019223bc3c9_909_1154.jpg",
    "isCollect": false,
    "pure_content": "天门中断楚江开，碧水东流至此回。\n两岸青山相对出，孤帆一片日边来。",
    "playing": false,
    "sound_duration": 19800,
    "name": "望天门山"
  },
  {
    "sound": "http://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/mp3/3a0376cd1342e7348a0e2435da717d43_38856.mp3",
    "author": "李白",
    "author_id": 0,
    "dynasty": "唐代",
    "id": "8089",
    "sound_pic": "https://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/images/3a07540d2def344e9fd094bfcb14f35a_909_1154.jpg",
    "isCollect": false,
    "pure_content": "渡远荆门外，来从楚国游。\n山随平野尽，江入大荒流。\n月下飞天镜，云生结海楼。\n仍怜故乡水，万里送行舟。",
    "playing": false,
    "sound_duration": 38856,
    "name": "渡荆门送别"
  },
  {
    "sound": "http://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/mp3/3a04b689172d60cb6be69f9056bfe257_22536.mp3",
    "author": "李白",
    "author_id": 0,
    "dynasty": "唐代",
    "id": "8014",
    "isCollect": false,
    "pure_content": "李白乘舟将欲行，忽闻岸上踏歌声。\n桃花潭水深千尺，不及汪伦送我情。",
    "playing": false,
    "sound_duration": 22536,
    "name": "赠汪伦"
  },
  {
    "sound": "http://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/mp3/3a03773e71089639ebf6951d9d9576ab_62928.mp3",
    "author": "李白",
    "author_id": 0,
    "dynasty": "唐代",
    "id": "70874",
    "sound_pic": "http://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/images/3a03867249baf202f24910af80a390b8_909_1154.jpg",
    "isCollect": false,
    "pure_content": "金樽清酒斗十千，玉盘珍羞直万钱。(羞同：馐；直同：值)\n停杯投箸不能食，拔剑四顾心茫然。\n欲渡黄河冰塞川，将登太行雪满山。(雪满山一作：雪暗天)\n闲来垂钓碧溪上，忽复乘舟梦日边。(碧一作：坐)\n行路难，行路难，多歧路，今安在？\n长风破浪会有时，直挂云帆济沧海。",
    "playing": false,
    "sound_duration": 62928,
    "name": "行路难·其一"
  },
  {
    "sound": "http://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/mp3/3a03a514ad222da72328f9d562fcbc06_54384.mp3",
    "author": "苏轼",
    "author_id": 0,
    "dynasty": "宋代",
    "id": "49480",
    "sound_pic": "http://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/images/3a03a5375b6217de2a9f52267651490a_909_1154.jpg",
    "isCollect": false,
    "pure_content": "十年生死两茫茫，不思量，自难忘。千里孤坟，无处话凄凉。纵使相逢应不识，尘满面，鬓如霜。\n夜来幽梦忽还乡，小轩窗，正梳妆。相顾无言，惟有泪千行。料得年年肠断处，明月夜，短松冈。",
    "playing": false,
    "sound_duration": 54384,
    "name": "江城子·乙卯正月二十日夜记梦",
    "video_id": "24"
  },
  {
    "sound": "https://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/mp3/3a0807b31338d1d2d6c57a7e7c6ff664_15908.mp3",
    "author": "王维",
    "author_id": 0,
    "dynasty": "唐代",
    "id": "5773",
    "isCollect": false,
    "pure_content": "红豆生南国，春来发几枝。\n愿君多采撷，此物最相思。",
    "playing": false,
    "sound_duration": 15908,
    "name": "相思"
  },
  {
    "sound": "https://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/mp3/3a09a80c8e48a77583a2065f4c8f3342_25200.mp3",
    "author": "李清照",
    "author_id": 0,
    "dynasty": "宋代",
    "id": "52794",
    "sound_pic": "https://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/images/3a09b81b2bfdac047c7190c543cd85a7_909_1154.png",
    "isCollect": false,
    "pure_content": "昨夜雨疏风骤，浓睡不消残酒。试问卷帘人，却道海棠依旧。知否，知否？应是绿肥红瘦。",
    "playing": false,
    "sound_duration": 25200,
    "name": "如梦令·昨夜雨疏风骤"
  },
  {
    "sound": "https://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/mp3/3a098a6e6e12e480ef46f565c9b02dfa_30912.mp3",
    "author": "李清照",
    "author_id": 0,
    "dynasty": "宋代",
    "id": "52809",
    "sound_pic": "https://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/images/3a09b8198ceff66de8c5fb65cbca5cfa_909_1154.png",
    "isCollect": false,
    "pure_content": "薄雾浓云愁永昼，瑞脑销金兽。佳节又重阳，玉枕纱厨，半夜凉初透。(厨通：橱；销金兽一作：消金兽)\n东篱把酒黄昏后，有暗香盈袖。莫道不销魂，帘卷西风，人比黄花瘦。(人比一作：人似)",
    "playing": false,
    "sound_duration": 30912,
    "name": "醉花阴·薄雾浓云愁永昼"
  },
  {
    "sound": "http://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/mp3/3a04596700f5fb68583881b86f8e9d86_15312.mp3",
    "author": "李清照",
    "author_id": 0,
    "dynasty": "宋代",
    "id": "70957",
    "sound_pic": "https://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/images/3a0874a5d804660f676981aac3c4ee6a_909_1154.png",
    "isCollect": false,
    "pure_content": "生当作人杰，死亦为鬼雄。\n至今思项羽，不肯过江东。",
    "playing": false,
    "sound_duration": 15312,
    "name": "夏日绝句"
  },
  {
    "sound": "https://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/mp3/3a0bef0d2ca94575d9daa580f7ef7cc9_66481.mp3",
    "author": "李清照",
    "author_id": 0,
    "dynasty": "宋代",
    "id": "52821",
    "sound_pic": "https://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/images/3a0c3c67522eacf715bb088267d1a47d_909_1154.png",
    "isCollect": false,
    "pure_content": "寻寻觅觅，冷冷清清，凄凄惨惨戚戚。乍暖还寒时候，最难将息。三杯两盏淡酒，怎敌他、晚来风急！雁过也，正伤心，却是旧时相识。\n满地黄花堆积，憔悴损，如今有谁堪摘？守着窗儿，独自怎生得黑！梧桐更兼细雨，到黄昏、点点滴滴。这次第，怎一个愁字了得！",
    "playing": false,
    "sound_duration": 66481,
    "name": "声声慢·寻寻觅觅"
  },
  {
    "sound": "https://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/mp3/3a0beed320d19cdcdbfac62129054ed7_46733.mp3",
    "author": "李清照",
    "author_id": 0,
    "dynasty": "宋代",
    "id": "52802",
    "sound_pic": "https://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/images/3a09b7c4beade1b391aa928949b8af46_909_1154.png",
    "isCollect": false,
    "pure_content": "红藕香残玉簟秋。轻解罗裳，独上兰舟。云中谁寄锦书来？雁字回时，月满西楼。\n花自飘零水自流。一种相思，两处闲愁。此情无计可消除，才下眉头，却上心头。",
    "playing": false,
    "sound_duration": 46733,
    "name": "一剪梅·红藕香残玉簟秋",
    "video_id": "29"
  },
  {
    "sound": "https://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/mp3/3a09aed04dba8fc02f48c6826209a34e_27312.mp3",
    "author": "李清照",
    "author_id": 0,
    "dynasty": "宋代",
    "id": "52817",
    "sound_pic": "https://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/images/3a09aecfde36474ff30f08b3e10c8417_909_1154.png",
    "isCollect": false,
    "pure_content": "风住尘香花已尽，日晚倦梳头。\n物是人非事事休，欲语泪先流。\n闻说双溪春尚好，也拟泛轻舟。\n只恐双溪舴艋舟，载不动许多愁。",
    "playing": false,
    "sound_duration": 27312,
    "name": "武陵春·春晚"
  },
  {
    "sound": "http://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/mp3/3a03cea2d64415595b194cca8a563c35_20400.mp3",
    "author": "王维",
    "author_id": 0,
    "dynasty": "唐代",
    "id": "71047",
    "sound_pic": "https://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/images/3a07cf90589e2dfdcb5562815cc12e70_909_1154.jpg",
    "isCollect": false,
    "pure_content": "远看山有色，近听水无声。\n春去花还在，人来鸟不惊。",
    "playing": false,
    "sound_duration": 20400,
    "name": "画"
  },
  {
    "sound": "https://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/mp3/3a0807a97b45fb9b4bec7814c2735d8c_28248.mp3",
    "author": "王维",
    "author_id": 0,
    "dynasty": "唐代",
    "id": "5649",
    "isCollect": false,
    "pure_content": "楚塞三湘接，荆门九派通。\n江流天地外，山色有无中。\n郡邑浮前浦，波澜动远空。\n襄阳好风日，留醉与山翁。",
    "playing": false,
    "sound_duration": 28248,
    "name": "汉江临眺"
  },
  {
    "sound": "https://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/mp3/3a06dd2b672fec0df9ddaae47b14bc3b_13923.mp3",
    "author": "王维",
    "author_id": 0,
    "dynasty": "唐代",
    "id": "5737",
    "isCollect": false,
    "pure_content": "空山不见人，但闻人语响。\n返景入深林，复照青苔上。",
    "playing": false,
    "sound_duration": 13923,
    "name": "鹿柴"
  },
  {
    "sound": "http://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/mp3/3a037aee77932f42253ceca5144d2573_27288.mp3",
    "author": "王维",
    "author_id": 0,
    "dynasty": "唐代",
    "id": "5636",
    "sound_pic": "http://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/images/3a03867e3917251d3f3618016c2b9770_909_1154.jpg",
    "isCollect": false,
    "pure_content": "空山新雨后，天气晚来秋。\n明月松间照，清泉石上流。\n竹喧归浣女，莲动下渔舟。\n随意春芳歇，王孙自可留。",
    "playing": false,
    "sound_duration": 27288,
    "name": "山居秋暝"
  },
  {
    "sound": "https://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/mp3/3a15d3df59c005d087a0930c5859bcde_32664.mp3",
    "author": "王维",
    "author_id": 0,
    "dynasty": "唐代",
    "id": "5653",
    "sound_pic": "http://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/images/3a0512f1d487dda27db02c9fc045f1f1_909_1154.jpg",
    "isCollect": false,
    "pure_content": "单车欲问边，属国过居延。\n征蓬出汉塞，归雁入胡天。\n大漠孤烟直，长河落日圆。\n萧关逢候骑，都护在燕然。",
    "playing": false,
    "sound_duration": 32664,
    "name": "使至塞上"
  },
  {
    "sound": "http://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/mp3/3a04594776f4590a9511be5c091c0952_23520.mp3",
    "author": "王维",
    "author_id": 0,
    "dynasty": "唐代",
    "id": "5780",
    "sound_pic": "https://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/images/3a0874a3cb5e1eab9a056ae3a7399e51_909_1154.png",
    "isCollect": false,
    "pure_content": "独在异乡为异客，每逢佳节倍思亲。\n遥知兄弟登高处，遍插茱萸少一人。",
    "playing": false,
    "sound_duration": 23520,
    "name": "九月九日忆山东兄弟"
  },
  {
    "sound": "https://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/mp3/3a0897efed4c4501632fadce592a5076_23064.mp3",
    "author": "王维",
    "author_id": 0,
    "dynasty": "唐代",
    "id": "5782",
    "isCollect": false,
    "pure_content": "渭城朝雨浥轻尘，客舍青青柳色新。\n劝君更尽一杯酒，西出阳关无故人。",
    "playing": false,
    "sound_duration": 23064,
    "name": "送元二使安西"
  },
  {
    "sound": "http://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/mp3/3a045981350fb341b986070d0be5281b_20544.mp3",
    "author": "王维",
    "author_id": 0,
    "dynasty": "唐代",
    "id": "5753",
    "sound_pic": "https://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/images/3a08d57f8d2741c7dd61043c0f30d945_909_1154.png",
    "isCollect": false,
    "pure_content": "人闲桂花落，夜静春山空。\n月出惊山鸟，时鸣春涧中。",
    "playing": false,
    "sound_duration": 20544,
    "name": "鸟鸣涧"
  },
  {
    "sound": "https://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/mp3/3a0892cfdd6ab0cf1128ad8877ce0c00_29712.mp3",
    "author": "王维",
    "author_id": 0,
    "dynasty": "唐代",
    "id": "5637",
    "isCollect": false,
    "pure_content": "中岁颇好道，晚家南山陲。\n兴来每独往，胜事空自知。\n行到水穷处，坐看云起时。\n偶然值林叟，谈笑无还期。",
    "playing": false,
    "sound_duration": 29712,
    "name": "终南别业"
  },
  {
    "sound": "http://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/mp3/3a03a5181a10c10e81ce80103ad5a338_31440.mp3",
    "author": "杜甫",
    "author_id": 0,
    "dynasty": "唐代",
    "id": "11187",
    "sound_pic": "http://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/images/3a03a53810c1768db2c76bd8ca24c087_909_1154.jpg",
    "isCollect": false,
    "pure_content": "细草微风岸，危樯独夜舟。\n星垂平野阔，月涌大江流。\n名岂文章著，官应老病休。\n飘飘何所似，天地一沙鸥。",
    "playing": false,
    "sound_duration": 31440,
    "name": "旅夜书怀"
  },
  {
    "sound": "http://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/mp3/3a0352fe78809611ac6e60d4e3c8b6ad_59496.mp3",
    "author": "杜甫",
    "author_id": 0,
    "dynasty": "唐代",
    "id": "11098",
    "sound_pic": "https://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/images/3a075270c67e0bb5e1b4e6252c65582e_909_1154.png",
    "isCollect": false,
    "pure_content": "风急天高猿啸哀，渚清沙白鸟飞回。\n无边落木萧萧下，不尽长江滚滚来。\n万里悲秋常作客，百年多病独登台。\n艰难苦恨繁霜鬓，潦倒新停浊酒杯。",
    "playing": false,
    "sound_duration": 59496,
    "name": "登高"
  },
  {
    "sound": "https://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/mp3/3a0a34b12cd72b31a053d08285a721b6_36120.mp3",
    "author": "杜甫",
    "author_id": 0,
    "dynasty": "唐代",
    "id": "10968",
    "sound_pic": "",
    "isCollect": false,
    "pure_content": "好雨知时节，当春乃发生。\n随风潜入夜，润物细无声。\n野径云俱黑，江船火独明。\n晓看红湿处，花重锦官城。",
    "playing": false,
    "sound_duration": 36120,
    "name": "春夜喜雨"
  },
  {
    "sound": "http://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/mp3/3a037ade5e5259875d91225c9fa10a80_21504.mp3",
    "author": "杜甫",
    "author_id": 0,
    "dynasty": "唐代",
    "id": "71194",
    "sound_pic": "http://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/images/3a038679c42b68606575a66ffb7bc125_909_1154.jpg",
    "isCollect": false,
    "pure_content": "两个黄鹂鸣翠柳，一行白鹭上青天。\n窗含西岭千秋雪，门泊东吴万里船。",
    "playing": false,
    "sound_duration": 21504,
    "name": "绝句"
  },
  {
    "sound": "http://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/mp3/3a05c798d0b7e5c117cd94d0b39dddef_39024.mp3",
    "author": "杜甫",
    "author_id": 0,
    "dynasty": "唐代",
    "id": "10928",
    "sound_pic": "https://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/images/3a05c798bac981dcc85c3736d8a52dbf_909_1154.jpg",
    "isCollect": false,
    "pure_content": "丞相祠堂何处寻？锦官城外柏森森。\n映阶碧草自春色，隔叶黄鹂空好音。\n三顾频烦天下计，两朝开济老臣心。\n出师未捷身先死，长使英雄泪满襟。",
    "playing": false,
    "sound_duration": 39024,
    "name": "蜀相"
  },
  {
    "sound": "http://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/mp3/3a0376bb3fa68427c3bfb4f3d1cb8015_42744.mp3",
    "author": "杜甫",
    "author_id": 0,
    "dynasty": "唐代",
    "id": "11218",
    "sound_pic": "http://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/images/3a0386605c3d4bc3067cd2d3279ca44b_909_1154.jpg",
    "isCollect": false,
    "pure_content": "岁暮阴阳催短景，天涯霜雪霁寒宵。\n五更鼓角声悲壮，三峡星河影动摇。\n野哭千家闻战伐，夷歌数处起渔樵。(千家一作：几家)\n卧龙跃马终黄土，人事音书漫寂寥。(音书一作：依依)",
    "playing": false,
    "sound_duration": 42744,
    "name": "阁夜"
  },
  {
    "sound": "http://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/mp3/3a04598da58c7d6d5557555bc48f0bfc_44976.mp3",
    "author": "杜甫",
    "author_id": 0,
    "dynasty": "唐代",
    "id": "11064",
    "sound_pic": "https://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/images/3a08d5285ce844a97004ef31d4a0987a_909_1154.png",
    "isCollect": false,
    "pure_content": "剑外忽传收蓟北，初闻涕泪满衣裳。\n却看妻子愁何在，漫卷诗书喜欲狂。\n白日放歌须纵酒，青春作伴好还乡。\n即从巴峡穿巫峡，便下襄阳向洛阳。",
    "playing": false,
    "sound_duration": 44976,
    "name": "闻官军收河南河北"
  },
  {
    "sound": "https://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/mp3/3a0a5c28c7437dbc8c9940cf6b0648dc_41064.mp3",
    "author": "杜甫",
    "author_id": 0,
    "dynasty": "唐代",
    "id": "10886",
    "isCollect": false,
    "pure_content": "戍鼓断人行，边秋一雁声。(边秋 一作:秋边)\n露从今夜白，月是故乡明。\n有弟皆分散，无家问死生。\n寄书长不达，况乃未休兵。",
    "playing": false,
    "sound_duration": 41064,
    "name": "月夜忆舍弟"
  },
  {
    "sound": "http://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/mp3/3a0376d5f5a3491866ff73d52e26cbeb_44664.mp3",
    "author": "杜甫",
    "author_id": 0,
    "dynasty": "唐代",
    "id": "10835",
    "sound_pic": "https://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/images/3a07786bf2acaa98a7437dd0be768689_909_1154.jpg",
    "isCollect": false,
    "pure_content": "国破山河在，城春草木深。\n感时花溅泪，恨别鸟惊心。\n烽火连三月，家书抵万金。\n白头搔更短，浑欲不胜簪。",
    "playing": false,
    "sound_duration": 44664,
    "name": "春望"
  },
  {
    "sound": "https://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/mp3/3a16a803c5bfefd6a3d7c8eddefb8ffd_78419.mp3",
    "author": "杜甫",
    "author_id": 0,
    "dynasty": "唐代",
    "id": "10388",
    "isCollect": false,
    "pure_content": "人生不相见，动如参与商。\n今夕复何夕，共此灯烛光。\n少壮能几时，鬓发各已苍。\n访旧半为鬼，惊呼热中肠。\n焉知二十载，重上君子堂。\n昔别君未婚，儿女忽成行。\n怡然敬父执，问我来何方。\n问答乃未已，驱儿罗酒浆。\n夜雨剪春韭，新炊间黄粱。\n主称会面难，一举累十觞。\n十觞亦不醉，感子故意长。\n明日隔山岳，世事两茫茫。",
    "playing": false,
    "sound_duration": 78419,
    "name": "赠卫八处士"
  },
  {
    "sound": "http://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/mp3/3a0376b9ef0b77971c09c5ed9fa81b6d_37176.mp3",
    "author": "杜甫",
    "author_id": 0,
    "dynasty": "唐代",
    "id": "11550",
    "sound_pic": "https://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/images/3a07527122bad90d3217d8ec0025e6f1_909_1154.png",
    "isCollect": false,
    "pure_content": "昔闻洞庭水，今上岳阳楼。\n吴楚东南坼，乾坤日夜浮。\n亲朋无一字，老病有孤舟。\n戎马关山北，凭轩涕泗流。",
    "playing": false,
    "sound_duration": 37176,
    "name": "登岳阳楼"
  },
  {
    "sound": "http://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/mp3/3a0376c801db11c7dc4f57c7b0126fe3_39888.mp3",
    "author": "杜甫",
    "author_id": 0,
    "dynasty": "唐代",
    "id": "10374",
    "sound_pic": "http://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/images/3a0386637ea471a7dd4d10c159760c24_909_1154.jpg",
    "isCollect": false,
    "pure_content": "岱宗夫如何？齐鲁青未了。\n造化钟神秀，阴阳割昏晓。\n荡胸生曾云，决眦入归鸟。(曾同：层)\n会当凌绝顶，一览众山小。",
    "playing": false,
    "sound_duration": 39888,
    "name": "望岳"
  },
  {
    "sound": "https://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/mp3/3a190d28707aa2c223490d3208ef0ac6_36624.mp3",
    "author": "李贺",
    "author_id": 0,
    "dynasty": "唐代",
    "id": "20289",
    "isCollect": false,
    "pure_content": "老兔寒蟾泣天色，云楼半开壁斜白。\n玉轮轧露湿团光，鸾佩相逢桂香陌。\n黄尘清水三山下，更变千年如走马。\n遥望齐州九点烟，一泓海水杯中泻。",
    "playing": false,
    "sound_duration": 36624,
    "name": "梦天"
  },
  {
    "sound": "http://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/mp3/3a03f30b7a1fa892b89b442d54f998d5_21768.mp3",
    "author": "李贺",
    "author_id": 0,
    "dynasty": "唐代",
    "id": "71220",
    "sound_pic": "https://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/images/3a07fe022e4d42e2b26f792b1777b51a_909_1154.jpg",
    "isCollect": false,
    "pure_content": "大漠沙如雪，燕山月似钩。\n何当金络脑，快走踏清秋。",
    "playing": false,
    "sound_duration": 21768,
    "name": "马诗二十三首·其五"
  },
  {
    "sound": "http://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/mp3/3a03531b5a1207d6ee76e705bfccc3d6_81000.mp3",
    "author": "李贺",
    "author_id": 0,
    "dynasty": "唐代",
    "id": "20270",
    "sound_pic": "http://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/images/3a03a53a07dd237b5513178b81c72162_909_1154.jpg",
    "isCollect": false,
    "pure_content": "吴丝蜀桐张高秋，空山凝云颓不流。\n江娥啼竹素女愁，李凭中国弹箜篌。\n昆山玉碎凤凰叫，芙蓉泣露香兰笑。\n十二门前融冷光，二十三丝动紫皇。\n女娲炼石补天处，石破天惊逗秋雨。\n梦入神山教神妪，老鱼跳波瘦蛟舞。\n吴质不眠倚桂树，露脚斜飞湿寒兔。",
    "playing": false,
    "sound_duration": 81000,
    "name": "李凭箜篌引"
  },
  {
    "sound": "https://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/mp3/3a15d3e18c67ee2cf36e68c1189707c7_22512.mp3",
    "author": "李贺",
    "author_id": 0,
    "dynasty": "唐代",
    "id": "71327",
    "isCollect": false,
    "pure_content": "男儿何不带吴钩，收取关山五十州。\n请君暂上凌烟阁，若个书生万户侯？",
    "playing": false,
    "sound_duration": 22512,
    "name": "南园十三首·其五"
  },
  {
    "sound": "https://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/mp3/3a15d3e77b6a1f9a4d652952944e0d15_37272.mp3",
    "author": "李贺",
    "author_id": 0,
    "dynasty": "唐代",
    "id": "20285",
    "sound_pic": "https://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/images/3a07786c3f7bd0b99d1b6edef05d71bd_909_1154.jpg",
    "isCollect": false,
    "pure_content": "黑云压城城欲摧，甲光向日金鳞开。(向日一作：向月)\n角声满天秋色里，塞上燕脂凝夜紫。(塞上一作：塞土)\n半卷红旗临易水，霜重鼓寒声不起。\n报君黄金台上意，提携玉龙为君死。",
    "playing": false,
    "sound_duration": 37272,
    "name": "雁门太守行"
  },
  {
    "sound": "https://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/mp3/3a153fd388c1c25d4ba4f3af1889dadc_41304.mp3",
    "author": "李煜",
    "author_id": 0,
    "dynasty": "五代",
    "id": "47047",
    "isCollect": false,
    "pure_content": "东风吹水日衔山，春来长是闲。落花狼藉酒阑珊，笙歌醉梦间。\n佩声悄，晚妆残，凭谁整翠鬟？留连光景惜朱颜，黄昏独倚阑。",
    "playing": false,
    "sound_duration": 41304,
    "name": "阮郎归·呈郑王十二弟"
  },
  {
    "sound": "https://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/mp3/3a10808525f681d7ada7f9a214a0905d_19565.mp3",
    "author": "李煜",
    "author_id": 0,
    "dynasty": "五代",
    "id": "71077",
    "isCollect": false,
    "pure_content": "深院静，小庭空，断续寒砧断续风。\n无奈夜长人不寐，数声和月到帘栊。",
    "playing": false,
    "sound_duration": 19565,
    "name": "捣练子令·深院静"
  },
  {
    "sound": "https://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/mp3/3a1535a2444e4b0f57ed818c974e0583_36672.mp3",
    "author": "李煜",
    "author_id": 0,
    "dynasty": "五代",
    "id": "47045",
    "isCollect": false,
    "pure_content": "别来春半，触目柔肠断。砌下落梅如雪乱，拂了一身还满。(柔肠断一作：愁肠断)\n雁来音信无凭，路遥归梦难成。离恨恰如春草，更行更远还生。",
    "playing": false,
    "sound_duration": 36672,
    "name": "清平乐·别来春半"
  },
  {
    "sound": "https://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/mp3/3a0a81cd68c4a4e369d9bd4ac4f8277a_53832.mp3",
    "author": "李煜",
    "author_id": 0,
    "dynasty": "五代",
    "id": "71076",
    "sound_pic": "https://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/images/3a0c3c6ac8b30069e5a672920a528302_909_1154.png",
    "isCollect": false,
    "pure_content": "帘外雨潺潺，春意阑珊。罗衾不耐五更寒。梦里不知身是客，一晌贪欢。\n独自莫凭栏，无限江山。别时容易见时难。流水落花春去也，天上人间。",
    "playing": false,
    "sound_duration": 53832,
    "name": "浪淘沙令·帘外雨潺潺"
  },
  {
    "sound": "https://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/mp3/3a09aed3c0b310930c2b4e1f76cc501d_36649.mp3",
    "author": "李煜",
    "author_id": 0,
    "dynasty": "五代",
    "id": "71074",
    "sound_pic": "https://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/images/3a0c3c7efc05462d8bd6b3ac90facaeb_909_1154.png",
    "isCollect": false,
    "pure_content": "无言独上西楼，月如钩。寂寞梧桐深院锁清秋。\n剪不断，理还乱，是离愁。别是一般滋味在心头。(一般一作：一番)",
    "playing": false,
    "sound_duration": 36649,
    "name": "相见欢·无言独上西楼"
  },
  {
    "sound": "https://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/mp3/3a0a5d15e670e57d48930d08d87b5369_40248.mp3",
    "author": "李煜",
    "author_id": 0,
    "dynasty": "五代",
    "id": "47040",
    "sound_pic": "https://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/images/3a0c3c656c999ea9d8a5d7cf953a499d_909_1154.png",
    "isCollect": false,
    "pure_content": "林花谢了春红，太匆匆。无奈朝来寒雨晚来风。\n胭脂泪，相留醉，几时重。自是人生长恨水长东。(相留一作：留人)",
    "playing": false,
    "sound_duration": 40248,
    "name": "相见欢·林花谢了春红",
    "video_id": "28"
  },
  {
    "sound": "https://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/mp3/3a0aa61b324575e108029f008d63016c_23232.mp3",
    "author": "李煜",
    "author_id": 0,
    "dynasty": "五代",
    "id": "71492",
    "sound_pic": "https://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/images/3a0c3c644cd560c3d8acdecaf6ece31a_909_1154.png",
    "isCollect": false,
    "pure_content": "浪花有意千里雪，桃花无言一队春。一壶酒，一竿身，快活如侬有几人。",
    "playing": false,
    "sound_duration": 23232,
    "name": "渔父·浪花有意千里雪"
  },
  {
    "sound": "https://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/mp3/3a098a6128f93d9e6d75874cd11c4d3d_35265.mp3",
    "author": "李煜",
    "author_id": 0,
    "dynasty": "五代",
    "id": "71075",
    "isCollect": false,
    "pure_content": "一重山，两重山。山远天高烟水寒，相思枫叶丹。\n菊花开，菊花残。塞雁高飞人未还，一帘风月闲。",
    "playing": false,
    "sound_duration": 35265,
    "name": "长相思·一重山"
  },
  {
    "sound": "https://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/mp3/3a153f89b2df75c954f26f6cbf170941_45024.mp3",
    "author": "李煜",
    "author_id": 0,
    "dynasty": "五代",
    "id": "72731",
    "isCollect": false,
    "pure_content": "人生愁恨何能免，销魂独我情何限！故国梦重归，觉来双泪垂。\n高楼谁与上？长记秋晴望。往事已成空，还如一梦中。",
    "playing": false,
    "sound_duration": 45024,
    "name": "子夜歌·人生愁恨何能免"
  },
  {
    "sound": "http://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/mp3/3a035304708c7db41a31de3821749b11_57024.mp3",
    "author": "李煜",
    "author_id": 0,
    "dynasty": "五代",
    "id": "70838",
    "sound_pic": "https://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/images/3a0c3c5e410b419f52dcaf5a36a42c11_909_1154.png",
    "isCollect": false,
    "pure_content": "春花秋月何时了？往事知多少。小楼昨夜又东风，故国不堪回首月明中。\n雕栏玉砌应犹在，只是朱颜改。问君能有几多愁？恰似一江春水向东流。",
    "playing": false,
    "sound_duration": 57024,
    "name": "虞美人·春花秋月何时了",
    "video_id": "30"
  },
  {
    "sound": "https://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/mp3/3a108045c050a3bbb44dcf9d7480bc01_19320.mp3",
    "author": "李煜",
    "author_id": 0,
    "dynasty": "五代",
    "id": "71995",
    "isCollect": false,
    "pure_content": "多少恨，昨夜梦魂中。还似旧时游上苑，车如流水马如龙。花月正春风。",
    "playing": false,
    "sound_duration": 19320,
    "name": "望江南·多少恨"
  },
  {
    "sound": "https://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/mp3/3a152ff374e3d2840970546aa8c4cbe8_35186.mp3",
    "author": "李煜",
    "author_id": 0,
    "dynasty": "五代",
    "id": "47048",
    "isCollect": false,
    "pure_content": "昨夜风兼雨，帘帏飒飒秋声。烛残漏断频欹枕，起坐不能平。\n世事漫随流水，算来一梦浮生。醉乡路稳宜频到，此外不堪行。(一梦一作：梦里)",
    "playing": false,
    "sound_duration": 35186,
    "name": "乌夜啼·昨夜风兼雨"
  },
  {
    "sound": "https://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/mp3/3a09b884e1e23f1fd751418ed8d960e3_26880.mp3",
    "author": "鱼玄机",
    "author_id": 0,
    "dynasty": "唐代",
    "id": "42919",
    "sound_pic": "https://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/images/3a0c3c60ca89fa4a2830fc71dc868495_909_1154.png",
    "isCollect": false,
    "pure_content": "翠色连荒岸，烟姿入远楼。\n影铺秋水面，花落钓人头。\n根老藏鱼窟，枝低系客舟。\n萧萧风雨夜，惊梦复添愁。",
    "playing": false,
    "sound_duration": 26880,
    "name": "赋得江边柳"
  },
  {
    "sound": "https://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/mp3/3a09b85050dc09d9f1b907c724bd38eb_27696.mp3",
    "author": "鱼玄机",
    "author_id": 0,
    "dynasty": "唐代",
    "id": "42956",
    "sound_pic": "https://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/images/3a0c3c62dfda64463c36741911fe21d4_909_1154.png",
    "isCollect": false,
    "pure_content": "江南江北愁望，相思相忆空吟。\n鸳鸯暖卧沙浦，鸂鶒闲飞橘林。\n烟里歌声隐隐，渡头月色沉沉。\n含情咫尺千里，况听家家远砧。",
    "playing": false,
    "sound_duration": 27696,
    "name": "隔汉江寄子安"
  },
  {
    "sound": "https://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/mp3/3a09d14d3ae489e910556c91d4b127f1_20760.mp3",
    "author": "鱼玄机",
    "author_id": 0,
    "dynasty": "唐代",
    "id": "42941",
    "sound_pic": "https://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/images/3a0c3c6e48891c2627907eadb5aca81e_909_1154.png",
    "isCollect": false,
    "pure_content": "无限荷香染暑衣，阮郎何处弄船归。\n自惭不及鸳鸯侣，犹得双双近钓矶。",
    "playing": false,
    "sound_duration": 20760,
    "name": "闻李端公垂钓回寄赠"
  },
  {
    "sound": "https://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/mp3/3a09b883e177f03303b30b7a3d0b97bd_30840.mp3",
    "author": "鱼玄机",
    "author_id": 0,
    "dynasty": "唐代",
    "id": "42932",
    "sound_pic": "https://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/images/3a0c3c6cc7a1f59b10764b8427730a22_909_1154.png",
    "isCollect": false,
    "pure_content": "苦思搜诗灯下吟，不眠长夜怕寒衾。\n满庭木叶愁风起，透幌纱窗惜月沈。\n疏散未闲终遂愿，盛衰空见本来心。\n幽栖莫定梧桐处，暮雀啾啾空绕林。",
    "playing": false,
    "sound_duration": 30840,
    "name": "冬夜寄温飞卿"
  },
  {
    "sound": "https://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/mp3/3a09b89696f13477af935313e6c5ff48_19536.mp3",
    "author": "鱼玄机",
    "author_id": 0,
    "dynasty": "唐代",
    "id": "42958",
    "sound_pic": "https://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/images/3a0c3c6f8f85be519fbffe18c1714391_909_1154.png",
    "isCollect": false,
    "pure_content": "枫叶千枝复万枝，江桥掩映暮帆迟。\n忆君心似西江水，日夜东流无歇时。",
    "playing": false,
    "sound_duration": 19536,
    "name": "江陵愁望寄子安"
  },
  {
    "sound": "https://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/mp3/3a179a685173fef30953ba82cc8d5c41_23136.mp3",
    "author": "鱼玄机",
    "author_id": 0,
    "dynasty": "唐代",
    "id": "42937",
    "isCollect": false,
    "pure_content": "云峰满目放春晴，历历银钩指下生。\n自恨罗衣掩诗句，举头空羡榜中名。",
    "playing": false,
    "sound_duration": 23136,
    "name": "游崇真观南楼睹新及第题名处"
  },
  {
    "sound": "https://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/mp3/3a09d15e2e11c02aa295e98bc26ba274_26184.mp3",
    "author": "鱼玄机",
    "author_id": 0,
    "dynasty": "唐代",
    "id": "42920",
    "sound_pic": "https://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/images/3a09d15ddec1f6f245c23763953cdeb4_909_1154.png",
    "isCollect": false,
    "pure_content": "羞日遮罗袖，愁春懒起妆。\n易求无价宝，难得有心郎。\n枕上潜垂泪，花间暗断肠。\n自能窥宋玉，何必恨王昌？",
    "playing": false,
    "sound_duration": 26184,
    "name": "赠邻女"
  },
  {
    "sound": "http://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/mp3/3a03775679f360f7f45a02611ecba516_32952.mp3",
    "author": "辛弃疾",
    "author_id": 0,
    "dynasty": "宋代",
    "id": "57795",
    "sound_pic": "http://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/images/3a03867344eb894d4349f5a51e2c354e_909_1154.jpg",
    "isCollect": false,
    "pure_content": "少年不识愁滋味，爱上层楼。爱上层楼，为赋新词强说愁。\n而今识尽愁滋味，欲说还休。欲说还休，却道“天凉好个秋”！",
    "playing": false,
    "sound_duration": 32952,
    "name": "丑奴儿·书博山道中壁"
  },
  {
    "sound": "https://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/mp3/3a0a8c292facf56f65516e9ed97f27bd_49680.mp3",
    "author": "辛弃疾",
    "author_id": 0,
    "dynasty": "宋代",
    "id": "57601",
    "isCollect": false,
    "pure_content": "东风夜放花千树，更吹落，星如雨。宝马雕车香满路。凤箫声动，玉壶光转，一夜鱼龙舞。\n蛾儿雪柳黄金缕，笑语盈盈暗香去。众里寻他千百度，蓦然回首，那人却在，灯火阑珊处。",
    "playing": false,
    "sound_duration": 49680,
    "name": "青玉案·元夕",
    "video_id": "12"
  },
  {
    "sound": "http://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/mp3/3a05c796949f0bee60f330ad5612dee7_39131.mp3",
    "author": "辛弃疾",
    "author_id": 0,
    "dynasty": "宋代",
    "id": "57913",
    "sound_pic": "https://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/images/3a0c3c67c1775bef3354a3e6054e5a77_909_1154.png",
    "isCollect": false,
    "pure_content": "醉里挑灯看剑，梦回吹角连营。八百里分麾下炙，五十弦翻塞外声，沙场秋点兵。\n马作的卢飞快，弓如霹雳弦惊。了却君王天下事，赢得生前身后名。可怜白发生！",
    "playing": false,
    "sound_duration": 39131,
    "name": "破阵子·为陈同甫赋壮词以寄之",
    "video_id": "7"
  },
  {
    "sound": "https://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/mp3/3a1123ea1abf89627d22273b0f0d05e0_85944.mp3",
    "author": "辛弃疾",
    "author_id": 0,
    "dynasty": "宋代",
    "id": "57768",
    "isCollect": false,
    "pure_content": "绿树听鹈鴂。更那堪、鹧鸪声住，杜鹃声切。啼到春归无寻处，苦恨芳菲都歇。算未抵、人间离别。马上琵琶关塞黑，更长门、翠辇辞金阙。看燕燕，送归妾。\n将军百战身名裂。向河梁、回头万里，故人长绝。易水萧萧西风冷，满座衣冠似雪。正壮士、悲歌未彻。啼鸟还知如许恨，料不啼清泪长啼血。谁共我，醉明月。",
    "playing": false,
    "sound_duration": 85944,
    "name": "贺新郎·别茂嘉十二弟"
  },
  {
    "sound": "https://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/mp3/3a153950601acaa212f0fbe56e88d3db_33593.mp3",
    "author": "辛弃疾",
    "author_id": 0,
    "dynasty": "宋代",
    "id": "57580",
    "isCollect": false,
    "pure_content": "郁孤台下清江水，中间多少行人泪？西北望长安，可怜无数山。青山遮不住，毕竟东流去。江晚正愁余，山深闻鹧鸪。",
    "playing": false,
    "sound_duration": 33593,
    "name": "菩萨蛮·书江西造口壁"
  },
  {
    "sound": "https://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/mp3/3a1124025394afaea5d6d35f66dfbc6a_95328.mp3",
    "author": "辛弃疾",
    "author_id": 0,
    "dynasty": "宋代",
    "id": "57769",
    "isCollect": false,
    "pure_content": "邑中园亭，仆皆为赋此词。一日，独坐停云，水声山色，竞来相娱。意溪山欲援例者，遂作数语，庶几仿佛渊明思亲友之意云。\n甚矣吾衰矣。怅平生、交游零落，只今余几！白发空垂三千丈，一笑人间万事。问何物、能令公喜？我见青山多妩媚，料青山见我应如是。情与貌，略相似。\n一尊搔首东窗里。想渊明、《停云》诗就，此时风味。江左沉酣求名者，岂识浊醪妙理。回首叫、云飞风起。不恨古人吾不见，恨古人不见吾狂耳。知我者，二三子。",
    "playing": false,
    "sound_duration": 95328,
    "name": "贺新郎·甚矣吾衰矣"
  },
  {
    "sound": "https://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/mp3/3a0decd255b65b2a721d733a4b9412fa_32992.mp3",
    "author": "辛弃疾",
    "author_id": 0,
    "dynasty": "宋代",
    "id": "57678",
    "sound_pic": "http://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/images/3a0512f43a96cca3b3c2ce2f889b66d9_909_1154.jpg",
    "isCollect": false,
    "pure_content": "明月别枝惊鹊，清风半夜鸣蝉。稻花香里说丰年，听取蛙声一片。\n七八个星天外，两三点雨山前。旧时茅店社林边，路转溪桥忽见。(溪桥一作：溪头)",
    "playing": false,
    "sound_duration": 32992,
    "name": "西江月·夜行黄沙道中"
  },
  {
    "sound": "https://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/mp3/3a0d0e4af97534645187e2f5ce4f1819_56032.mp3",
    "author": "辛弃疾",
    "author_id": 0,
    "dynasty": "宋代",
    "id": "57521",
    "isCollect": false,
    "pure_content": "楚天千里清秋，水随天去秋无际。遥岑远目，献愁供恨，玉簪螺髻。落日楼头，断鸿声里，江南游子。把吴钩看了，栏杆拍遍，无人会，登临意。(栏杆一作：阑干)\n休说鲈鱼堪脍，尽西风，季鹰归未？求田问舍，怕应羞见，刘郎才气。可惜流年，忧愁风雨，树犹如此！倩何人唤取，红巾翠袖，揾英雄泪！",
    "playing": false,
    "sound_duration": 56032,
    "name": "水龙吟·登建康赏心亭"
  },
  {
    "sound": "http://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/mp3/3a03776400f2ab5f3011b933fd389120_48048.mp3",
    "author": "辛弃疾",
    "author_id": 0,
    "dynasty": "宋代",
    "id": "58029",
    "sound_pic": "https://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/images/3a0c3c81636c8e8e7ebb0baf2e9bbda6_909_1154.png",
    "isCollect": false,
    "pure_content": "何处望神州？满眼风光北固楼。千古兴亡多少事？悠悠。不尽长江滚滚流。\n年少万兜鍪，坐断东南战未休。天下英雄谁敌手？曹刘。生子当如孙仲谋。",
    "playing": false,
    "sound_duration": 48048,
    "name": "南乡子·登京口北固亭有怀"
  },
  {
    "sound": "http://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/mp3/3a03530085ac1eb0c248032647d62e92_104040.mp3",
    "author": "辛弃疾",
    "author_id": 0,
    "dynasty": "宋代",
    "id": "57989",
    "sound_pic": "http://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/images/3a03865cff3866b1aa24571d33edb909_909_1154.jpg",
    "isCollect": false,
    "pure_content": "千古江山，英雄无觅，孙仲谋处。舞榭歌台，风流总被，雨打风吹去。斜阳草树，寻常巷陌，人道寄奴曾住。想当年，金戈铁马，气吞万里如虎。\n元嘉草草，封狼居胥，赢得仓皇北顾。四十三年，望中犹记，烽火扬州路。可堪回首，佛狸祠下，一片神鸦社鼓。凭谁问：廉颇老矣，尚能饭否？",
    "playing": false,
    "sound_duration": 104040,
    "name": "永遇乐·京口北固亭怀古"
  },
  {
    "sound": "https://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/mp3/3a1719b21b898991079e3601138c0ab2_43008.mp3",
    "author": "辛弃疾",
    "author_id": 0,
    "dynasty": "宋代",
    "id": "57567",
    "isCollect": false,
    "pure_content": "唱彻《阳关》泪未干，功名馀事且加餐。浮天水送无穷树，带雨云埋一半山。\n今古恨，几千般，只应离合是悲欢？江头未是风波恶，别有人间行路难！",
    "playing": false,
    "sound_duration": 43008,
    "name": "鹧鸪天·送人"
  },
  {
    "sound": "http://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/mp3/3a0454ef03a45e6ec2b3144cdcaf6405_47328.mp3",
    "author": "辛弃疾",
    "author_id": 0,
    "dynasty": "宋代",
    "id": "57847",
    "sound_pic": "http://d.nanxiani.cn/poetry/images/3a0454eef308951efb6ccbdc9b26eeba_909_1154.jpg",
    "isCollect": false,
    "pure_content": "一轮秋影转金波，飞镜又重磨。把酒问姮娥：被白发，欺人奈何？\n乘风好去，长空万里，直下看山河。斫去桂婆娑，人道是，清光更多。",
    "playing": false,
    "sound_duration": 47328,
    "name": "太常引·建康中秋夜为吕叔潜赋"
  }
]
